Z||000003||87GTZ34||06-22-2001||12:51 AM||||They would be at:<BR>4810 Clover Rd.<BR>Greensboro, NC 27405<P>I don't know that being relatively close helps much.  I was tracking a package on the web once and it sat in couple of warehouses too long.  If they need space and don't need to meet a commitment date the package will sit.  When I ordered my door spring compressor a month ago it only took about a week to SFLA.<p>[This message has been edited by 87GTZ34 (edited 06-22-2001).]||||reg||1
